---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro'
---

<Layout 
  title="Dark Matter Detection Cheat Sheet | Free Direct, Indirect, Collider"
  description="Complete dark matter detection cheat sheet with direct, indirect, and collider methods. Free download for physics students."
>
  <section class="hero">
    <h1>Dark Matter Detection<br><span>Cheat Sheet</span></h1>
    <p>Direct, indirect, and collider methods. From underground labs to particle colliders.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Direct Detection</h2>
    <div class="formula-grid">
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Method</h3>
        <pre><code>WIMP scatters off nucleus
Nuclear recoil detected
Underground: low background
Annual modulation: Earth's velocity through halo
Experiments: XENON, LUX, PandaX</code></pre>
      </div>
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Challenges</h3>
        <pre><code>Very low event rate: ~ 10⁻⁴⁶ cm²
Background from neutrinos (neutrino fog)
Need huge detectors (tonne-scale)
Cryogenic temperatures for some detectors</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Indirect Detection</h2>
    <div class="formula-grid">
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Method</h3>
        <pre><code>Dark matter annihilation/decay products
Gamma rays: Fermi-LAT, H.E.S.S.
Neutrinos: IceCube
Antimatter: AMS-02
Excess signals in galactic center</code></pre>
      </div>
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Challenges</h3>
        <pre><code>Astrophysical backgrounds
Uncertain dark matter density profile
No confirmed detection
Ambiguous signals</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Collider Production</h2>
    <div class="formula-grid">
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Method</h3>
        <pre><code>LHC: produce dark matter particles
Missing energy signature
Mono-jet events: jet + missing energy
Limits on dark matter mass and coupling
No discovery yet</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Complementary Approaches</h2>
    <div class="formula-grid">
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Multi-Strategy</h3>
        <pre><code>Direct: WIMP-nucleus scattering
Indirect: WIMP-WIMP annihilation
Collider: WIMP pair production
All three needed to confirm discovery
Cross-checks between methods</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Download</h2>
    <p>Print this page or save as PDF for quick reference.</p>
    <p><strong>Tip:</strong> Use Ctrl+P (Cmd+P on Mac) to print or save as PDF.</p>
  </section>
</Layout>
